<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA ALL OUT FOR 100 V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA ALL OUT FOR 100 V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, in reply to South Africa's first innings of 235, were bowled out for 100 in 39.1 overs on the second day of the first test at Kingsmead on Friday.</p>
</text>
